  "prefLabel": "Liq 702.03 Application Packet",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Liq 702.03 Application Packet. Upon the submission of Form LIQ-A1, the licensing agent shall provide the applicant with the license type application as described in Liq 702.07 and the license type worksheet as described in Liq 702.07(b) and part Liq 705 of these rules.\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes #1 and #2 at chapter heading for Liq 700) #13114, eff 9-25-20",
